// 0 Caption :
"P2621643155" "<x=0.725 y=0.15 t=4 d=4><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Aurora, Penelope, I know you both have been through quite an ordeal, but there's still a lot we need to do."
// 4 Desdemona :
"P3223947928" "<em talk>"
// 0 Desdemona :
"P3370278249" "<anim None>"
// 4.5 Aurora :
"P4048380026" "<em talk><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Tilman is still a threat. If we can't disconnect her, she can just control someone else.  We'll have to..."
// 0.2 Caption :
"P1373416254" "<x=0.7 y=0.1 t=1 d=2><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>Aurora!"
// 1 Calvin :
"P659315211" "<goto E10>"
// 0.1 Desdemona :
"P3527577051" "<face E10>"
// 3 Caption :
"P1340825834" "<x=0.7 y=0.15 t=3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>You're finally free!  Thank you all!  Thank you for rescuing my wife!"
// 4 Aurora :
"P1157862370" "<em talk><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Wife?! Who do you think you are?"
// 4 Calvin :
"P951789379" "<em talk><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>It's me, Calvin! You... don't  remember your own husband?!"
// 4 Aurora :
"P3005919069" "<em talk><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Husband?  I don't have a-<em><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Wait... Calvin? Calvin Scott?! My patient from the asylum?  I almost didn't recognize you."
// 4 Calvin :
"P2921889192" "<em talk><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>No!  Tilman did something to your mind... She's made you forget me!  She's made you forget US!"
// 4 Aurora :
"P3853800325" "<em talk><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Mr. Scott, please. Shalice Tilman has done much, but I remember you, and we are not married."
// 0.5 Desdemona :
"P949944015" "<em no>"
// 1 Caption :
"P3008258881" "<x=0.35 y=0.2 t=1 d=4><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Wait... what?"
// 2.5 Caption :
"P3511485081" "<x=0.35 y=0.25 t=2.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Calvin Scott was your patient? You mean to tell me the 'leader' of the Resistance is...."
// 0.1 Calvin :
"P1348890387" "<color Paragon><bgcolor Black>No.<em><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>No!<em><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>This can't be!"
// 5 Aurora :
"P964081199" "<em talk><color Violet><bgcolor Black>Schizophrenic, yes. I treated his depression for years. He had lost everyone in the wars, and grew attached to me... He must have fabricated that I was his wife when Tilman betrayed my trust."
// 6 Calvin :
"P3140181709" "<em frustrated><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>That isn't true!  That can't be...<em><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>That would make everything I've fought for... Everything I've done...<em><color Paragon><bgcolor Black> NO! It's not a lie!  It's... not... it can't be... I can't be... I'm not crazy!"
// DisplayName for Aurora :
"P738080329" "Aurora Borealis"
// DisplayName for Calvin :
"P4018337905" "Calvin Scott"
// DisplayName for Desdemona :
"P3638897958" "Desdemona"
