// Script Variable Greeting :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Aurora 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AuroraIntro Text :
"P1758531248" "I... I am so sorry you had to witness that, {HeroName}. To have been trapped for so long in a prison of my own making was bad enough. But to be confronted with Mr. Scott in such a way so soon after my freedom was... disconcerting. I hope you will forgive me for being unable to control his outburst."
// Answer Text :
"P1716764371" "It's an understandable reaction, given what you've endured."
// Answer Text :
"P3328248991" "Sorry? I'm sorry you didn't kill him!"
// Answer Text :
"P3247853270" "So, what now, Aurora?"
// Page AuroraUnderstanding Text :
"P659780605" "It would not be so bad if I hadn't brought it on myself. I should never have let Shalice do this... to think of all that's been inflicted on Praetoria because of my 'sacrifice'.<br><br><color orange>Aurora sighs. She sounds heartbroken.</color><br><br>We only wanted to do what was right for the people, for Praetoria. Somewhere along the way, it all went wrong.<br><br><color goldenrod>Aurora looks down at the ground for a moment, then looks back at you.</color><br><br>What's worse, though, is that I emerge from my imprisonment to find my former patient here, greeting me as his wife! I know that poor Calvin had developed a crush on me -- patients will sometimes do that with their doctors -- but I never expected he would take his delusions this far.<br><br>Between Tilman and Scott, I am responsible for so much pain and misery. All I was trying to do was help... and now it is all so very broken.<br><br><color goldenrod>Tears begin welling up in Aurora's eyes.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2805161613" "There's still a chance to fix it all. I intend on seeing that happen."
// Page AuroraAggressive Text :
"P2464431727" "I... I couldn't do such a thing. He was my patient, and it is ultimately my responsibility to see him treated well and safely.<br><br> Still, I cannot believe he has really been telling people I was his wife all this time. Worse yet, he was using that fictitious relationship to to justify his actions!<br><br>The mayhem caused by Shalice Tilman... bearing responsibility for that is bad enough. But, it appears I also failed Calvin, and because of that failure, many have suffered. I bear responsibility for his actions too.<br><br>Hopefully, though, this one here will never pose a threat again."
// Answer Text :
"P2514255214" "I'm sure he won't. And Cole? I intend on dealing with him, too."
// Page AuroraFinish Text :
"P4203924715" "Thank you, {HeroName}. I'm sure that you and your allies will bring a closure to Praetoria that Cole could never achieve.<br><br>Now, if you please, I've been away for a long time and I need to rest. It will take me some time to get my bearings once again. After that, though, I should like to see if I can help you in your future endeavors."
// Answer Text :
"P1043112260" "Be well, then, Aurora."
// Answer Text :
"P1767901884" "Rest up then. You'd be no good to me until you're ready, anyway."
// Answer Text :
"P2926258754" "So, if I may ask, how come you still look like Mother Mayhem?"
// Page AuroraLooks Text :
"P4146383943" "I look like this because this <i>is</i> me. The person you know as Mother Mayhem is just the consciousness of Shalice Tilman. She has been <i>mind riding</i> in my body, keeping my mind submerged under her domination. This is my body...<br><br><color goldenrod>Aurora gives a concerning look at her outfit.</color><br><br>Shalice went and dressed <i>me</i> up in this... getup, and since I've been freed, I haven't really had much opportunity to find anything more... <i>modest</i>."
// Page AuroraEnding Text :
"P2678041815" "After I get my bearings, you mean?<br><br>I... I presume that I will be joining Desdemona in the Resistance. I don't quite think she's realized yet that she is the leader of the Resistance now."
// Answer Text :
"P2047017539" "How do you mean?"
// Page AuroraEnding2 Text :
"P2667018520" "Well, she wears the mask of Vanessa DeVore. She knows all that Vanessa knew, and as you've seen, she's proven quite capable of doing what needs to be done against impossible odds. Whether she realizes it or not, the Carnival of Light look to her for leadership, and through them, the Resistance.<br><br>Perhaps more importantly, Calvin Scott is in no way capable of leading the Resistance. I know he has been seen as their leader for some time, but I am also aware of the many atrocities he has committed. And with today's outburst....<br><br><color goldenrod>Aurora's voice trails off.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P661370727" "With today's outburst what?"
// Page AuroraEnding3 Text :
"P1649728163" "<color goldenrod>Aurora sighs dejectedly</color><br><br>The last refuge for Calvin Scott's sanity resided in his delusion that I was his wife. Now, that illusion has been shattered in front of all of us. I fear it is a blow from which he will not recover.<br><br>Calvin Scott always walked a fine line between the heroic and the villainous, just like Emperor Cole. Unlike Cole, however, Scott has nothing left to believe in.<br><br><color goldenrod>Aurora pauses for a moment.</color><br><br>No, that's not exactly right. He has one thing left to believe in: the complete and utter destruction of Cole's regime by any means necessary, and I'm sure he'll be successful in rallying a number of the Resistance to aid him in seeing <i>that</i> through."
// Answer Text :
"P503327287" "How do you know all these things?"
// Page AuroraEnding4 Text :
"P837903004" "Remember, it was my mind suppressed by Praetor Tilman. It was my body she possessed. Everything she did, I did, and everything she knew, I know. I may not realize all that I know just yet.  It's still an odd feeling just being in possession of my own faculties again.<br><br>However, Calvin Scott and Desdemona were coming up frequently enough that they are familiar to me. The opinions and reports and stories about them and their exploits remain fresh in my mind, and I don't think it's a stretch to come to these conclusions."
// Answer Text :
"P795800828" "We'll deal with Scott if we need to. Cole is the main threat now."
// Page AuroraEnding5 Text :
"P3858526100" "Yes, yes he is. While you prepare for that, I will do all I can to assist Desdemona in her duties to the Resistance. We will be ready to help in anyway we can if you need us, and we will be ready to help fill the void left by Cole's defeat."
// Answer Text :
"P388131802" "Thank you, Aurora. <Leave>"
// DisplayName for Aurora :

