// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page CalvinScottIntro Text :
"P3970944204" "I have waited for this day a long time, {HeroName}. We've got them on the run!"
// Answer Text :
"P3740846128" "Wait... we have them on the run?"
// Answer Text :
"P4108691055" "So, uh... you and Aurora. All that was a lie?"
// Page CalvinScottProblem Text :
"P2053730073" "Yes! Don't you see it? You've already taken out nearly all of the Emperor's key lieutenants, secured the safety of the city and shown the world what a traitor Cole is. The mere fact that his and Tilman's hands were forced into this global mindwashing is testament to how close they are to defeat!"
// Answer Text :
"P4034663603" "That's one perspective on this situation."
// Page CalvinScottNextSteps Text :
"P3601772839" "It's the only way to look at it. This is a move made out of desperation... and it finally gives me the opportunity for which I've waited for so long. My dearest Aurora is within reach. All you need to do is confront that witch Tilman and get her out of my wife's body! Then she'll be mine again!"
// Answer Text :
"P1332483268" "Something seems a bit... off..."
// Page CalvinScottSuspicious Text :
"P3466165734" "I'm just excited. This is the closest I've come to getting her back, and when she's finally free, I'll be able to unleash my full force on Cole. With her safety assured, nothing will stop me from making sure he pays for the torment we've suffered.<br><br>Now, get in there and get her back!"
// Answer Text :
"P572155404" "Uh-huh... how is it you're not mindwashed again?"
// Answer Text :
"P1107859161" "O...K...? Keep it together, Calvin."
// Page CalvinScottFree Text :
"P1468956160" "Are you serious? You do realize that my wife is the person Tilman is inhabiting? The love of my life is buried beneath the unrelenting madness of that witch... do you think she can do anything to stop me? I will do anything to get her back. She has no strength over me, because when I see or hear her, I know Aurora is there... and as long as she is there, Tilman can do nothing to me!"
// Answer Text :
"P1546078138" "You seem a bit excitable. I'm going to go talk to the others."
// Page CalvinScottInsanityPartOne Text :
"P1633549359" "<color orange>Calvin Scott gibbers something incoherent. Whatever happened just now appears to have shattered his mind.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P554023001" "You and Aurora were never married, were you, Calvin?"
// Page CalvinScottInsanityPartTwo Text :
"P2716278765" "Yes! Yes, we were! I know we were! I've seen it in my dreams!<br><br>Would it even matter if it weren't true? Would it!? Cole is a monster and he took her away from me! For that he deserves to die!"
// Answer Text :
"P3174865027" "You realize what you've done in the name of your delusions, right?"
// Page CalvinScottInsanityPartThree Text :
"P2307857810" "It was not a delusion! No! No, it couldn't be... all those people... all those... he had it coming! He...<br><br><color orange>Calvin resumes his gibbering. There doesn't appear to be anything more you'll get from him at the moment.</color>"
// DisplayName for CalvinScott :

