// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Penelope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page PenelopeIntro Text :
"P717811416" "Rusty! You did it! You broke me out of Mother's ivory tower, along with the True Sky Star that she was using all along!<br><br>I'm so happy that you and Fake Mom were able to pull it all off!"
// Answer Text :
"P3154505656" "It's okay Penelope, you can talk normally now."
// Answer Text :
"P1256395099" "... Fake Mom?"
// Answer Text :
"P4211402886" "You looked quite different in the Network, Penelope."
// Answer Text :
"P883461690" "What will you do now, Penelope?"
// Page Outfit Text :
"P3383839479" "Oh! That? That is the outfit of my <i>dreams</i>, Rusty! It's how I've always imagined myself always looking, being a <i>super hero</i> and fighting crime!<br><br>Now that I <i>can</i> look like that, I will! I'm different from all of my playtime friends now! I'm special!"
// Answer Text :
"P4005298733" "... Got it."
// Page FakeMom Text :
"P3473029706" "Fake Mom, Rusty, come on! You've been with her this entire time. She's not the Real Mom, even though she has her face.<br><br>I... know what happened to Real Mom, all of my playtime friends know from the moving images that were put out. I know that she's in that Special Place now, where all the good Moms go. <i>Mother</i> won't be there, though, not after all she's done.<br><br>I'm... just happy that Real Mom didn't do all that for nothing, that Fake Mom is here to finish what she started."
// Answer Text :
"P40862225" "There's also Metronome. He has come a long way, just to save you."
// Page PenelopeFreed Text :
"P737284024" "Normal? This is normal, Rusty, don't be silly! It's all to...<br><br>It's... all to...<br><br>I... I don't have to... Rusty, there's no more storm, is there? No more rain to hide from, no more lightning. It's quiet now, the sun is out and I can let myself stand in it.<br><br>I don't even... I barely remember how it used to be, Rusty, before being kept in the tower. The Black Knights... the teddy bears... my playtime friends... I don't even know what their <i>real</i> names were. And Glowball! Oh, Glowball..."
// Answer Text :
"P2944287658" "Metronome, right? He has come a long way, just to save you."
// Page PenelopeMetronome Text :
"P1631580913" "I know... Glowball came back into the light, Rusty, and I'm so happy. I knew he wouldn't forget who he was, I just knew it! He cared about me more than the leader of the Black Knights!<br><br>I just hope Glowball stays as a bright, shiny ball and not the red ball of anger he used to be. He could help out Mirror City so much when this is all over!<br><br>It will take some time, but I know that I can get myself back into reality, Rusty. Maybe then, we can both have a normal conversation. You, me, Glowball, True Sky Star, and Fake Mom!"
// Answer Text :
"P770534165" "We'll see about that. There's still much to be done."
// Page PenelopeEnding Text :
"P73347530" "Why, Rusty, can't you tell? I'm going to help Glowball and True Sky Star and Fake Mom make reality all better! They're really going to need my help!"
// Answer Text :
"P3040961453" "OK, Penelope. You do that."
// DisplayName for PenelopeYin :
